 on the mentioned rejection of this","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616436527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616944299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101927#issuecomment-2616944299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101927","id":2616944299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b-2ar","user":{"login":"StefanCristian","id":1596515,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY1MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596515?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian","html_url":"https://github.com/StefanCristian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StefanCristian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T21:34:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T21:34:27Z","body":"> No update yet, it's just been a few days, and you haven't really responded to the suggestions and requests\r\n> \r\n> For example an issue with specific details to track this, and some details upstream with clang, also any details on the mentioned rejection of this\r\n\r\nI have updated the ticket everything I have, and a step by step instructions to get to it (simple and fast reproducible steps).\r\nI'm just trying to manually compile Godot on Gentoo with Clang on Gentoo, nothing more.\r\n\r\nAnd the whole Gentoo toolchain is compiled with DFORTIFY_SOURCE >= 1, which makes it conflict with Clang's lack of support for glibc's wrappers for FORTIFY_SOURCE, but there are workarounds to that so Clang _understands what to do_, and this small patch seems to fix it for many other projects that have thirdpary/jpeg-compressor as dependency as well due library reordering \r\n\r\nI have no other details than this. And I might have confused the maintainers/authors of that third-party, as I can't seem to get to any link from them having the discussion on this topic, since the library itself seems to be rather unmaintained by anyone anymore since 2012: https://code.google.com/archive/p/jpeg-compressor/downloads\r\n\r\nSo, in the case of unmaintained upstream library that you still use, @AThousandShips, I honestly don't know what to recommend. That is, if you're using **that** same library or someone else's.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616944299/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616949332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101927#issuecomment-2616949332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101927","id":2616949332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b-3pU","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A